# Request: step k of one car (hakoniwa-robot-runtime#16, hakoniwa-scenario-pro memo 018).
# The runtime steps only when every robot's step-k request has arrived.
# step: step number k; drive: the same command as the AckermannDrive PDU
uint64 step
ackermann_msgs/AckermannDrive drive
---
# Response: the car after step k was applied and the world stepped once
# step: the request's k; result_code: 0 ok
# sim_time_usec: Hakoniwa time after the step
# pose / twist: world frame, ROS axes (x north, y west, z up)
uint64 step
uint32 result_code
uint64 sim_time_usec
geometry_msgs/Transform pose
geometry_msgs/Twist twist
